ba2633115d7e13de'), HumanMessage(content='You are now in the thinking stage. Choose a tool from the available tools and justify your choice.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='8acc543d-42dc-43b4-87c3-dee3455af1f2')]]
